{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not wait behind arbitrary cleanup after observing a JVM fatal.** After recording `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, the loop still invokes every remaining end hook. If one blocks, the fatal never reaches the invocation caller. Propagate JVM-fatal failures immediately or make subsequent cleanup bounded and best-effort; add a fatal-followed-by-blocked-hook test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77pzHN","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":112,"observation_digest":"c8729784a2daa5ba53c92313d24df6f8a911f3130710d496c592c17db7c0d1a7","observation_id":"aro_v1_zbzjpbfc3ks3uu6jemj5etpw7c","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:17:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_byfv4myspbecnazbrjfoecyqnt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"75df3beef29048065ff50232c240e58b4e06e311","reviewer":"codex","start_line":112,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_2vb4cyrnrq2b4hms7qqv5sxvps","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:17:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
